{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-title='SSH'>\r\n\t\t\tSSH\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Test sshd config, run a parallel debug daemon on another port, and connect with ssh -vvv.","label":"SSH debug","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh","label":"SSH","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Server<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Effective SSHD config<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>grep -v \"^#\" \/etc\/ssh\/sshd_config | grep -v \"^$\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Test mode<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-t<\/code> only checks the validity of the configuration file and sanity of the keys. This is useful for updating sshd reliably as configuration options may change.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTry a parallel version of sshd on a different (open) port with debugging enabled:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/usr\/sbin\/sshd -ddd -p &lt;listening port&gt; [-h ~\/.ssh\/id_rsa] [-f \/dev\/null]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/bin\/sshd -p &lt;listening port&gt; -D -d -e<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-d<\/code> is debug level. <code class='inline'>-dd<\/code> is debug1, debug2. Messages will tail to the screen. Post-login details like environment variables will show up on the client.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Client<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ssh -vvv -p &lt;listening port&gt; server-name<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh_debug\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh_debug\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh' data-title='SSH' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>SSH<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-title='SSH'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>SSH<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}